      "reasoning": "The chargeback breach warrants investigation, but volume_z of 0.6731890674983151 and ticket_drift of 1.0528093622079466 do not show a pronounced sales ramp. New-buyer GMV share does not establish thin buyer accounts, and non-delivery is unverified."
