  "recommended_action": "reserve",
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "Inspect the eight disputes: verify unique transaction references, reasons, status and merchant responses; reconcile the order denominator against source records.",
    "Check fulfillment for disputed orders and a small recent-order sample using shipment, delivery or service-completion evidence. Repeated verified non-delivery would strengthen bust-out concerns; verified fulfillment would weaken them.",
